ning bell chart - 101 - Chapter 13 12 stock market Bhavas - 103 - Chapter 14 Reading opening bell chart - 104 - 14.1 Grahas in 1st Bhava - 105 - 14.2 Grahas in 2nd Bhava - 107 - 14.3 Grahas in 3rd Bhava - 109 - 14.4 Grahas in 4th Bhava - 111 - 14.5 Grahas in 5th Bhava - 113 - 14.6 Grahas in 6th Bhava - 116 - 14.7 Grahas in 7th Bhava - 118 - 14.8 Grahas in 8th Bhava - 120 - 14.9 Grahas in 9th Bhava - 122 - 14.10 Grahas"}, "1410": {"doc_id": "astro_9aab7418", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. - 14.8 Grahas in 8th Bhava - 120 - 14.9 Grahas in 9th Bhava - 122 - 14.10 Grahas in 10th Bhava - 124 - 14.11 Grahas in 11th Bhava - 126 - Stock Market Astrology VI Contents 14.12 Grahas in 12th Bhava - 128 - Chapter 15 Business cycles - 130 - 15.1 Astrological periodicities in business cycles - 131 - 15.2 Sunspot theory of business cycle - 135 - Chapter 16 Astrological theory of business cycles - 136 - 16.1 Astrological theory of business cycles - 136 - 16.2 Historical evidences of major economic recessions?"}, "1411": {"doc_id": "astro_c12e4429", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. business cycles - 136 - 16.2 Historical evidences of major economic recessions? - 142 - 16.3 Watch out list of forthcoming combinations - 143 - Chapter 17 Astrological analysis of gold - 143 - Chapter 18 Astrological analysis of crude oil - 148 - Chapter 19 Diwali Muhrat trading - 150 - Chapter 20 Study of correlation - 151 - About the book - 153 - Stock Market Astrology VII Preface Preface Stock market astrology is an elaborate and descriptive work based on my aggressive research on study of astrological influences on financial markets and stock prices."}, "1412": {"doc_id": "astro_c037b506", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. arch on study of astrological influences on financial markets and stock prices. This book has been written after two decades of my hard work, research and professional experience in field of astrology, and after 11 years of dedicated aggressive research in application of astrological principles in predicting stock markets."}, "1413": {"doc_id": "astro_e3062f3c", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. research in application of astrological principles in predicting stock markets. This book contains a detailed and systematic study of astrological principles, which I have learned from my father, who in his turn has learned them from my grandfather, who was a High School principal in Calcutta and a learned scholar of astrology of his time, having many followers in city, during period of pre-independence and post-independent India. With application of these principles I have been able to successfully predict direction of stock markets and rise and fall in stock prices for years."}, "1414": {"doc_id": "astro_6b4207ad", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. predict direction of stock markets and rise and fall in stock prices for years. Language of book is kept such a simple and all complex astrological principles were explained in such a simple manner that anyone with little knowledge of astrology can easily grasp these principles and can tactfully apply them for predicting business cycles, periods of economic crisis, panic, recessionary periods and direction of individual stock prices in markets successfully or use them accordingly for trading in stock markets themselves and ensure profitability for themselves and their clients."}, "1415": {"doc_id": "astro_e6fb471d", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. k markets themselves and ensure profitability for themselves and their clients. Stock markets are considered as barometer of economy of any country. One can evaluate economic condition of any country by closely keeping eye on stock markets of that country. Good performing stock markets are Rasi of a healthy economy whereas a poor economy is reflected by dull performance of stock markets of that country."}, "1416": {"doc_id": "astro_02619815", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. poor economy is reflected by dull performance of stock markets of that country. But all stock markets are highly unpredictable in nature and since for a long period of time economists and analysts of stock markets keep trying to predict stock markets in advance, by help of technical analysis and fundamental analysis, though these tools of analysis are not fully dependable or reliable. As such, for a long period of time there has been a persistent demand for some dependable science to be able predict stock markets with greater accuracy."}, "1417": {"doc_id": "astro_4c5f1e4f", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. some dependable science to be able predict stock markets with greater accuracy. And science of astrology being oldest predictive science, must fill this gap by making a reliable effort to successfully predict dynamics of stock markets. Therefore it came into my mind to predict stock markets with help of my knowledge in astrology and compile all successful principles in form of a book."}, "1418": {"doc_id": "astro_d1cd7d69", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. knowledge in astrology and compile all successful principles in form of a book. I was finally motivated to carry this detailed research in astrologically predicting stock markets with my success in prediction of stock market fall in 1998-99 & 2000-01, which was made as a part of my mundane predictions for a magazine published from Chennai in 1995."}, "1419": {"doc_id": "astro_b3ac905d", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. a part of my mundane predictions for a magazine published from Chennai in 1995. Then after an aggressive research was carried out to predict stock markets with application of Stock Market Astrology VIII Scope for a stock market astrologer astrological principles, from 1999 to 2009 for almost 11 years, which helped me to compile successful principles which were helpful in prediction of stock markets, all together in form of this book."}, "1420": {"doc_id": "astro_32e10a1e", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. were helpful in prediction of stock markets, all together in form of this book. Predicting stock market is most interesting part of experimentation with astrological principles, since results and outcome is immediate or instant in many cases. It can be most interesting hobby for an astrologer, a passion for a stock trader and a professional predictive tool for analysts of stock markets, in years to come."}, "1421": {"doc_id": "astro_33fc4d69", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. a professional predictive tool for analysts of stock markets, in years to come. This branch of astrology, stock market astrology, is likely to grow much faster because of its importance in modern time and results of predictions being immediate, thus enabling people to judge credibility immediately, without having to wait for a longer period of time."}, "1422": {"doc_id": "astro_5ce59308", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ge credibility immediately, without having to wait for a longer period of time. With growing use of astrology in prediction of stock markets, it will be a come back for science of astrology to play a dominant role as a predictive science and to establish itself as a major player among various methods of stock market analysis in prediction of stock markets."}, "1423": {"doc_id": "astro_02d2c3ee", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. among various methods of stock market analysis in prediction of stock markets. Since stock markets are emerging as most attractive investment options among modern youth, coming from all walks of life and belonging to any field of profession, therefore any science that can be useful in successfully predicting stock markets will soon gain popularity among investors and traders. Results in stock markets are visible immediately, unlike in mundane or natal horoscopy, so evaluation of success and failures also get easier and immediate."}, "1424": {"doc_id": "astro_2ad85259", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. horoscopy, so evaluation of success and failures also get easier and immediate. Thus successful application of astrological principles in predicting stock markets can attract immediate attention of investors or public as a whole, thus being able to establish its importance as a predictive tool with a rapid pace."}, "1425": {"doc_id": "astro_ed4bcb95", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. being able to establish its importance as a predictive tool with a rapid pace. Scope for a stock market astrologer Although, developing stock market astrology as a career option may not be an attractive career option for a today's youth, but it may become need of hour in coming years, with more and more people getting attracted towards stock markets and with stock markets emerging as most attractive investment option of all. These ever increasing investors or traders in stock markets loose a large part of their investment due to their lack of knowledge about markets."}, "1426": {"doc_id": "astro_f4eddccd", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. a large part of their investment due to their lack of knowledge about markets. Therefore they need an expert advice to guide them properly in making profitable decisions in markets. Astrologers, having expertise in stock markets, can serve purpose by guiding investors and traders to make profits in markets. In return he may charge a professional fee for making any advice or may ask for a small part of any profit as a share arising out of his successful advice."}, "1427": {"doc_id": "astro_05cfccee", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. for a small part of any profit as a share arising out of his successful advice. It won't be surprising for me if, in coming years, large fund Bhavas start recruiting expert stock market astrologers as their fund managers or portfolio managers, instead of appointing any dull headed herd of irrelevant degree Stock Market Astrology IX Scope for a stock market astrologer holders, who repeatedly failed to understand market dynamics and irresponsibly kept playing a blind game in stock markets, with hard earned public money."}, "1428": {"doc_id": "astro_57500f80", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ibly kept playing a blind game in stock markets, with hard earned public money. Fund Bhavas need to deliver profits, to their investors to stand in financial markets, as such whichever way profitable advice may come to them, has to be welcomed by them in order to maximize their profits and to deliver best possible result to public. They cannot stick to non performing, orthodox, stereo-type fund managers for long if they need to survive in this highly competitive financial market."}, "1429": {"doc_id": "astro_f050bfc9", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. s for long if they need to survive in this highly competitive financial market. Fund Bhavas cannot stick for long time with those who can't serve their purpose of predicting markets ahead of time and with those who cannot maximize their profit earnings from markets. If they need to beat cut-throat competition of this financial world, they need to search for newer and alternative methods of fund managements, one of which can be stock market astrology."}, "1430": {"doc_id": "astro_f618e0ea", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. native methods of fund managements, one of which can be stock market astrology. With changing time and demand for more and more accurate analysis, they need to hire a stock market astrologer in order to deliver greater profit earnings for their investments and to their investors, in this era of cut-throat competition among various fund Bhavas. Any further research in this branch of astrology will further enrich principles of stock market astrology and level of accuracy of this science will also get improved."}, "1431": {"doc_id": "astro_ea93729b", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. market astrology and level of accuracy of this science will also get improved. Any attempt by any amateur or a professional astrologer in enriching principles of stock market astrology will add to credibility of this science. Thus further research into subject in coming days will open door for this science of astrology to play a dominant role in any financial decision making by any financial institutions or any government in deciding its economic policies, namely fiscal and monetary policies."}, "1432": {"doc_id": "astro_d02de5af", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ernment in deciding its economic policies, namely fiscal and monetary policies. As such I see a major role for science of stock market astrology and astrologers to play in world of financial markets, in days to come. They will have their dominance in framing of any investment decisions by any financial institution or fund Bhavas and in framing of economic policies by any country as well as in determining global economic affairs."}, "1433": {"doc_id": "astro_f9cd3081", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. omic policies by any country as well as in determining global economic affairs. Though this may be a far dream at present and may take years to happen, but ultimately that day will not be very far when world will have to globally recognize importance and dominance of this science in financial affairs. Indrodeep Banerjee M.A. (Economics) Astrologer & stock market consultant B-2045, Indira Nagar, Lucknow ?"}, "1434": {"doc_id": "astro_2569825c", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. Economics) Astrologer & stock market consultant B-2045, Indira Nagar, Lucknow ? 226016 Phone: 09415681544, 09455248927 Email: ind50001@yahoo.com Websites: www.TradingFunda.com & www.StockInspection.com Stock Market Astrology - 1 - Introduction to astrological concept Chapter 1 Introduction to astrological concept of stock market trading Astrology is a vast science which can foresee and explain a wide range of issues concerning human civilization, beginning from predicting individual fortune (natal horoscopy), global events (mundane astrology), earthquakes, political turmoil, economics, busines"}, "1435": {"doc_id": "astro_db32da79", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. l events (mundane astrology), earthquakes, political turmoil, economics, business cycles and even stock markets or financial markets of world. Everything and every change in this material world is predictable by application of principles of astrology, because nothing in this material world is independent of influences coming from cosmic world. The magnetic field or electromagnetic radiations originating from stars and Grahas exert strong influence on each and everything on this earth, however smaller or bigger it may be."}, "1436": {"doc_id": "astro_76f047d8", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ence on each and everything on this earth, however smaller or bigger it may be. Studying and experimenting with astrological influences on economic factors and financial markets or stock markets is most interesting of all branches of astrology, with most of results being immediately visible, whether it is a successful prediction or a failure, result is immediate."}, "1437": {"doc_id": "astro_5d3f9374", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. sible, whether it is a successful prediction or a failure, result is immediate. With every success achieving a new milestone in art of understanding cosmic language gets easier and every failure leads to rectification of weaker links in understanding this language of stars, either way wisdom of astrology gets enriched. Economic and financial markets being backbone for growth of any civilization, beginning right form days of barter trade practices, makes it an important subject for studying and understanding phenomenon of positive and negative developments in these markets."}, "1438": {"doc_id": "astro_20c5b063", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. nderstanding phenomenon of positive and negative developments in these markets. Economist of all ages tried to become master in understanding economic phenomenon and in art of predicting market dynamics in advance. Their prime motive of understanding economics is to be able to successfully predict future patterns of economics and financial system, well in advance of actual event. All studies of economics revolved around predictive tools of economics, whether it be micro-economics or macro- economics."}, "1439": {"doc_id": "astro_b158fad0", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. edictive tools of economics, whether it be micro-economics or macro- economics. Hence for astrologers, studying astrological influences on financial markets or stock markets became an important subject of study, with motive of mastering of predictive techniques of astrology, which govern entire system of financial markets globally, with intention of predicting moves of financial markets ahead of time."}, "1440": {"doc_id": "astro_9835b4c8", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. lobally, with intention of predicting moves of financial markets ahead of time. This study has gained a greater importance because all tools of financial analysis, especially tools of technical analysis and fundamental analysis, failed to meet standards and deliver proper prediction for financial market dynamics or stock market fluctuations."}, "1441": {"doc_id": "astro_ab6807e9", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. r proper prediction for financial market dynamics or stock market fluctuations. Stock Market Astrology - 2 - Introduction to astrological concept Although one must always keep in mind that stock markets are driven by more than one type of forces and multiple economic factors, thus making it difficult to study all factors and complexity of all these forces together."}, "1442": {"doc_id": "astro_f1da7531", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. it difficult to study all factors and complexity of all these forces together. Here one cannot deny fact that astrology also plays a major role in determining these market dynamics, thus its study can not only explain but can also properly predict many of moves of stock markets, which cannot be predicted by normal study of regular economic principles or financial tools of fundamental and technical analysis."}, "1443": {"doc_id": "astro_3cba1a33", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. r economic principles or financial tools of fundamental and technical analysis. It is surprising that astrology is still not considered as a perfect science by many of us, but I confidently maintain that if principles of astrology is thoroughly studied and perfectly applied, while making any prediction, then this science can be found as next to perfection than any other science of modern days."}, "1444": {"doc_id": "astro_f642fbcc", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ience can be found as next to perfection than any other science of modern days. One cannot deny importance of this science when it is a known fact that astrology is mother of all modern sciences and all established sciences of modern days has originated from science of astrology, once upon a time. Whether one talks about medical science or physics or mathematics, all of these sciences originally originated from astrology. All these sciences of modern days kept advancing and developing with specialized studies in respective fields."}, "1445": {"doc_id": "astro_d82c33a8", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ys kept advancing and developing with specialized studies in respective fields. Regular advancement and modification of these sciences continued until they started gaining a separate entity with passage of time. These developments were a vast process and took hundreds of years of continuous research and modification, which I will like to explain and discuss in some other work, due to limitations of this work, because focus of this work is on financial markets and stock markets only."}, "1446": {"doc_id": "astro_5bb40482", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ork, because focus of this work is on financial markets and stock markets only. As per economics, stock markets are said to be ruled by investor sentiments of greed and fear, but one cannot deny fact that all human sentiment, whether sentiment of greed and fear, are governed by astrological influences on human brains, which turns human beings at times aggressive, passionate, confident or depressed. In brief, we must understand that all sorts of human sentiment and behavior, including market sentiment and behavior are governed by movement of stars and Grahas in heaven."}, "1447": {"doc_id": "astro_b157e1b3", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. sentiment and behavior are governed by movement of stars and Grahas in heaven. Economists all over world worry about business cycles or trade cycles, try to analyze them in order to predict future reoccurrence of these cycles, well in advance, but fail to do so with their limited tools of financial analysis. The tools of fundamental analysis cannot explain for a stock being trapped in a weak or negative investor sentiment, however strong stock may be fundamentally."}, "1448": {"doc_id": "astro_372d55a4", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. weak or negative investor sentiment, however strong stock may be fundamentally. The tool of technical analysis is applicable only for intraday trades and short term market analysis, and it cannot justify long term market movements. Hence both these tools of financial analysis, technical analysis and fundamental analysis respectively, fail to meet perfection in long term market analysis and prediction of long term market trend."}, "1449": {"doc_id": "astro_177ebabc", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. rfection in long term market analysis and prediction of long term market trend. Stock Market Astrology - 3 - Introduction to astrological concept I don't mean to say that tools of financial analysis are of no use, they do serve as important tools of financial analysis. These tools are also of great help for investors and traders in making proper investment decisions, but where these tools of financial analysis fail to deliver proper analysis of markets, an astrological analysis can serve purpose by assisting and allowing a proper analysis and explanation of market dynamics."}, "1450": {"doc_id": "astro_702f67ad", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. by assisting and allowing a proper analysis and explanation of market dynamics. Astrological analysis, if used together along with fundamental analysis and technical analysis, can serve as boon in hands of traders and investors, helping them to efficiently plan their short term and long term moves in market. Astrological analysis, if used in combination with technical analysis & fundamental analysis, can prove to be of great help to traders and investors of stock markets."}, "1451": {"doc_id": "astro_ec2b72bb", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. lysis, can prove to be of great help to traders and investors of stock markets. Best results can be delivered if fundamental analysis & technical analysis is done within boundaries determined by astrological analysis. One must trade or invest in a stock only if astrological indicator for sector, in which stock belongs, is bullish, along with looking into fundamental strength and valuations (EPS, PE ratio etc.) of stock, as well as taking notice of technical indicators for stock."}, "1452": {"doc_id": "astro_edad9849", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. tio etc.) of stock, as well as taking notice of technical indicators for stock. Similarly decisions for selling or short selling a stock in market should be made when all astrological, fundamental and technical indicators shows weakness for stock. Although astrology can independently answer all market moves with outmost accuracy and any investment decision can be made accordingly, but paying attention to fundamental & technical analysis too is certainly beneficial."}, "1453": {"doc_id": "astro_569ff03a", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ying attention to fundamental & technical analysis too is certainly beneficial. In this book I have mentioned principles of astrology which are used by me in sector wise analysis of stock markets, instead of making any stock specific approach, so that these principles can be applied to vast number of stocks, falling into a particular sector."}, "1454": {"doc_id": "astro_ae956a6b", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ples can be applied to vast number of stocks, falling into a particular sector. Stock specific approach of analysis could have limited this book to stocks of any single stock market, while sector wise analysis will allow readers to apply these principles in analysis of stocks of any stock market of world, whether it be Dow Jones, London Stock Exchange or Indian Stock Markets or any other exchange of any country of world."}, "1455": {"doc_id": "astro_b27432c2", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. Exchange or Indian Stock Markets or any other exchange of any country of world. In order to begin study of astrological influences on stock markets, entire stock market stocks were classified into various sectors or in other words, entire market is divided into different sectors. After sector wise classification of stocks, assignment of rulership to every sector has been done, depending upon influence of Graha that was found governing movements of stocks prices of a particular sector. Then after influence of Graha on stock prices or investor sentiments of various sectors has been explained."}, "1456": {"doc_id": "astro_1b10a1fe", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. a on stock prices or investor sentiments of various sectors has been explained. Like pharmaceutical sector is governed by Mangal and whenever Mangal will transit through a friendly Rasi or it receives a friendly aspect from other Grahas then pharmaceutical sector will grow and pharmaceutical stocks will experience upward movement in their stock prices."}, "1457": {"doc_id": "astro_eb0d9af3", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. nd pharmaceutical stocks will experience upward movement in their stock prices. Stock Market Astrology - 4 - Introduction to astrological concept On other hand, whenever Mangal will transit through a enemy Rasi or receives any malefic aspect from other Grahas then sectors ruled by Mangal will experience sluggishness and stock prices of this particular sector will go down. The intensity of aspect determines intensity of stock price movements, both in positive as well as negative case."}, "1458": {"doc_id": "astro_1db727f4", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. intensity of stock price movements, both in positive as well as negative case. Similarly an explanation for business cycles or trade cycles has been found astrologically, by studying simultaneous movements and mutual aspects of outer Grahas. This has been thoroughly explained in chapter 'Astrological theory of business cycles'."}, "1459": {"doc_id": "astro_d5de3024", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. been thoroughly explained in chapter 'Astrological theory of business cycles'. This theory has been found more relevant because evidences from past, like Great depression of 1930 and Subprime mortgage crisis of 2008, seems to be supportive to this theory, as planetary aspects of outer Grahas at that time has been similar to that has been explained within this theory. Great depression of 1930 and Subprime mortgage crisis of 2008 were two major crises of stock markets in past 100 years, which any investor, trader or an economist can never forget in his or her life."}, "1460": {"doc_id": "astro_dfbd1f12", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. which any investor, trader or an economist can never forget in his or her life. And any study of stock market, without studying root cause of these two important events, will be incomplete. Thus by utilizing astrology to forecast market movements, an intelligent trader or investor can exit from market well in advance, by studying formation of any such fatal planetary combination in heaven and he / she can save his / her investment from being trapped into market, before any bear phase arrives or any panic strikes market."}, "1461": {"doc_id": "astro_54dc352b", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. trapped into market, before any bear phase arrives or any panic strikes market. Hence can move smartly ahead of market, by taking right decisions at right times, ahead of others. Here I would like to quote J.P. Morgan saying \"Millionaires do not use, billionaires use astrology to forecast markets.\" This explains fact that how much serious and careful are billionaires with their investments."}, "1462": {"doc_id": "astro_31115db1", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. fact that how much serious and careful are billionaires with their investments. If everyone pays similar attention to their investments and use astrological analysis to study market dynamics, then very few of us will loose their hard earned money in stock markets, rather will have key to earn riches from markets by utilizing astrological wisdom in making entry and exit decisions in market. Trading in gold and silver using astrology is also very interesting."}, "1463": {"doc_id": "astro_95010192", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. in market. Trading in gold and silver using astrology is also very interesting. Although gold meets hyper inflation with depression in stock markets but this metal too shines in its prices with cycle of Guru in heaven. Every times Guru gains strength in heaven, gold starts shining more brightly, attracting investor or buyer interest into it, so does it reflect in its price movements too. Thus shine of this yellow metal is fully dependent on cycle of Guru in heaven."}, "1464": {"doc_id": "astro_b7992994", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. Thus shine of this yellow metal is fully dependent on cycle of Guru in heaven. A smart trader can shift his or her portfolio to gold from stock markets and to stock markets from gold, by considering into opportunities well ahead of time, in a pre planned manner with application of wisdoms of astrology. Astrology can be helpful in planning all investment or trading moves into financial markets, much ahead of time, with a long to very long time frame in mind. Stock Market Astrology - 5 - Fundamentals & principles A price movement in crude oil prices is also influenced by astrological factors."}, "1465": {"doc_id": "astro_1630659e", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. price movement in crude oil prices is also influenced by astrological factors. By studying movements of Sani and Chandr, along with North & South Node taken together, predictions can be made in crude oil prices. Sani in Simha in conjunction with South Node kept this volatile fluid bubbling hot till Jul 2008. Even with South Node changing Rasi in May 2008, this volatile fluid was kept hot and bubbling till Jul 2008, Ketu still being within cusp of Rasi, until it touched all time high of US $ 147 a barrel in Jul 2008."}, "1466": {"doc_id": "astro_d8b5f44d", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. cusp of Rasi, until it touched all time high of US $ 147 a barrel in Jul 2008. Finally this black gold lost all its bubble with South Node moving away from conjunction with Sani in Simha, and soon it touched to low of US$ 32 per barrel in Jan 2009, shedding US $ 115 from its peak levels, within a short span of few months period. It happened so because South Node moved to a watery Rasi Karkataka, to get itself cooled from burning heat of previous Rasi Simha, which was burning hot due to its fiery nature."}, "1467": {"doc_id": "astro_f18b9f9a", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ing heat of previous Rasi Simha, which was burning hot due to its fiery nature. Intraday price movements and intraday market dynamics are studied by casting opening bell charts of market daily, for opening bell time of market for a given place, where market is located or situated, as well as considering lunar transits through various Rasis and Nakshatras, simultaneously. As I belong to school of Vedic astrology, following sidereal longitudes of Grahas for any calculations, all my calculations in my entire study has been based on sidereal longitudes of Grahas and N.C. Lahiri ephemeris."}, "1468": {"doc_id": "astro_91c68abe", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. tudy has been based on sidereal longitudes of Grahas and N.C. Lahiri ephemeris. Normally most of Indian astrologers of Vedic school of astrology follow sidereal longitudes, while western astrologers follow tropical longitudes. I consider that sidereal longitudes suits best in stock market analysis of stock prices, therefore western astrologers must convert tropical longitudes to sidereal longitudes by subtracting equinox differences, i.e. ayanamsa."}, "1469": {"doc_id": "astro_0af03fe9", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. tudes to sidereal longitudes by subtracting equinox differences, i.e. ayanamsa. Chapter 2 Fundamentals & principles used in astrological analysis of stock markets Fundamental idea behind astrological analysis of stock markets was that stock markets are said to be ruled by investor sentiments of greed and fear. Greed factor leads to buying sentiments into markets, which pulls stock prices to surge up while fear factor calls for selling pressure in market, which in turn drags stock prices down."}, "1470": {"doc_id": "astro_c894ced2", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. or calls for selling pressure in market, which in turn drags stock prices down. Here one cannot deny fact that all human sentiments, whether sentiment of greed or fear, are governed by astrological influences on human brains, which turns human beings at times aggressive, passionate, confident or depressed."}, "1471": {"doc_id": "astro_3145e060", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ich turns human beings at times aggressive, passionate, confident or depressed. Stock Market Astrology - 6 - Fundamentals & principles In brief, we must understand that all sorts of human sentiment and behavior, including market sentiments of buying and selling due to greed and fear in any stock or segment in market is governed by movements of stars and Grahas in heaven. Hence phenomenon of buying and selling in markets is correlated with transit of Grahas in zodiac, through various Rasis and constellations."}, "1472": {"doc_id": "astro_4c3c4a9b", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ted with transit of Grahas in zodiac, through various Rasis and constellations. Stock markets are often influenced by business cycles and business cycles keep periodically occurring and reoccurring in any economy from time to time. Therefore it has been a challenge for a long time to successfully predict occurrence of any business cycle in advance."}, "1473": {"doc_id": "astro_cba28a5f", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. long time to successfully predict occurrence of any business cycle in advance. As such many studies were made by economists in past, but it is for first time that relationship between astrological phenomenon and business cycles has been successfully established with help of transits of Sani and Guru through various Rasis of zodiac, depending upon tatwa or quality of Rasi through which Sani transits while receiving an aspect from Guru. This astrological phenomenon of two outer Grahas, namely Sani and Guru, has been explained thoroughly in chapter 'Astrological theory of business cycles'."}, "1474": {"doc_id": "astro_772afdb1", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. been explained thoroughly in chapter 'Astrological theory of business cycles'. With help of this principle any one can successfully predict future periods of economic boom and recession in markets and in economy. Authenticity of this principle has also been established with help of historical evidences in support of this principle, which were discussed in chapter 'Historical evidences of major economic recessions, including Great depression of 1930 & Subprime mortgage crisis of 2008; Confirming astrological theory of business cycles'."}, "1475": {"doc_id": "astro_b804bad5", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. me mortgage crisis of 2008; Confirming astrological theory of business cycles'. A list of forthcoming periods of economic recessions were also predicted with help of same principle, for help of readers in chapter 'Watchout list of forthcoming combinations for economic recessions as per astrological theory of business cycles'."}, "1476": {"doc_id": "astro_a3f4b805", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. nations for economic recessions as per astrological theory of business cycles'. Apart from above principle of determining business cycles, principle of Surya spot theory of business cycle, which determines abundant rainfall with period of sunspot maxima or higher density of sunspots and scarce rainfall with period of minimum sunspots, is also explained in chapter named 'Surya spot theory of business cycle'. Various other astrological periodicities helpful in determining business cycles were also discussed with help of chapter 'Astrological periodicities in business cycles'."}, "1477": {"doc_id": "astro_a277a15b", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. discussed with help of chapter 'Astrological periodicities in business cycles'. In order to make study of stock markets systematic and simplified, all stocks of market were classified into different sectors depending upon their nature of business, so that all stock of similar nature in their business can be studied together under one single sector. Thus sectors of stock markets are various sections of market under which all stocks of market are classified into, depending upon nature of stock and field of business it has been engaged upon."}, "1478": {"doc_id": "astro_fc24e1fd", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. depending upon nature of stock and field of business it has been engaged upon. This classification of stocks of any stock market makes study of market Stock Market Astrology - 7 - Fundamentals & principles much easier and comprehensive, thus facilitating study of a large number of stocks of similar nature under one section. After sector wise classification of stocks, all sectors with similar tatwa and ruled by a particular karaka Graha (significator Graha) is grouped together under that karaka or significator Graha."}, "1479": {"doc_id": "astro_9b000d63", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ignificator Graha) is grouped together under that karaka or significator Graha. A detailed classification of various sectors under their respective karaka Grahas is explained in chapter 'Grahas and market sectors'. Similarly various sectors of stock markets were also classified under twelve Rasis of zodiac according to their nature, tatwa and karakatwa of ruling Grahas. This classification of various sectors under twelve Rasis of zodiac is explained in chapter 'Ruling Rasis and market sectors'."}, "1480": {"doc_id": "astro_f72dff8e", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. elve Rasis of zodiac is explained in chapter 'Ruling Rasis and market sectors'. Now question arises in many minds that how does application of astrology actually work in stock markets? Here I will like to explain that actual application of astrological principles in stock markets is done by knowing price history or historical data for any particular stock and correlating that data with transits of karaka Graha of that stock and studying effects of favorable or unfavorable aspects on that karaka Graha, while on transit through various Rasis of zodiac."}, "1481": {"doc_id": "astro_51145ad6", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. aspects on that karaka Graha, while on transit through various Rasis of zodiac. A complete study of all stocks and sectors of market has been made in a similar manner, by going back into 10, 15, 20 years and more, into price history of a stock, astrological influences that have caused stock's prices to move up or down in past has been determined."}, "1482": {"doc_id": "astro_a5e6e22e", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. that have caused stock's prices to move up or down in past has been determined. Astrological causes for price movements of sectors were also determined in similar manner, and once these influences were identified, they were applied to experimentally predict movements of stock prices and for predicting sector wise up and down movements in market."}, "1483": {"doc_id": "astro_c00874f3", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. of stock prices and for predicting sector wise up and down movements in market. Successful influences of planetary transits, aspects and other astrological causes were identified for future application and all such results of transit of Grahas based on their karakatwas, through twelve Rasis of zodiac, were compiled together in form of chapter 'Transit of Grahas through twelve Rasis of zodiac'. Stock prices move up or down due to planetary influences on collective minds of investors, which in turn cause markets to go up or down."}, "1484": {"doc_id": "astro_a015fa2f", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. on collective minds of investors, which in turn cause markets to go up or down. It is well established fact that phases of Chandr have a powerful effect on mass mind set similar to that it has upon tides in rivers and oceans, so does transit of Chandr through various Nakshatras have different influence on different people, which causes for buying sentiments or selling sentiments in different sectors of market. Chandr transits through any single Nakshatra for a period of 23 to 27 hours, hence it influences intraday price movements of various stocks in markets."}, "1485": {"doc_id": "astro_6e0f0bcf", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. urs, hence it influences intraday price movements of various stocks in markets. It was established that transit of Chandr through Nakshatra influence intraday price movements in stocks and sectors signified by that particular Nakshatra Lord, depending upon favorable or unfavorable aspect falling upon Chandr Stock Market Astrology - 8 - Fundamentals & principles and Nakshatra Lord on that particular day."}, "1486": {"doc_id": "astro_70240709", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. logy - 8 - Fundamentals & principles and Nakshatra Lord on that particular day. Results of transit of Chandr through 27 Nakshatras, under various aspects from various Grahas, are elaborately explained, with real practical examples of intraday trading, in chapter 'Practical intraday trading with transit of Chandr through 27 Nakshatras'. Price movements in stock prices were systematically studied for various sectors of market one by one for 30 different sectors of market."}, "1487": {"doc_id": "astro_a170779a", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ed for various sectors of market one by one for 30 different sectors of market. Study of intraday, short term and long term price movements was conducted with help of transit results of Chandr, Surya and Guru respectively, through various Rasis of zodiac, under different aspects from various other Grahas. This systematic study of various market sectors has been explained in chapter 'Sector wise predicting intraday, short & long term market outlook'."}, "1488": {"doc_id": "astro_b72438ae", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. in chapter 'Sector wise predicting intraday, short & long term market outlook'. Astrologically it is an established fact that influence of a particular Graha gets intensified during certain particular hours of a day and that period is known as Hora period of that Graha. This Hora period was used to study intensified effect of Grahas on stock prices during certain particular hours of day and influence upon price movements were established under various aspects on that Graha from other Grahas."}, "1489": {"doc_id": "astro_80c1a299", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. vements were established under various aspects on that Graha from other Grahas. How Hora periods can be used in formulating trading strategies in intraday trading and effects of various horas in stock price movements under different aspects from different Grahas are discussed, with real practical examples of stock market trading in intraday, in chapter 'Practical strategies of intraday trading with Hora - planetary hours'. Principles of horary astrology and horary charts were also applied in study of stock markets and determining price movements of various market sectors."}, "1490": {"doc_id": "astro_27612302", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. udy of stock markets and determining price movements of various market sectors. Intraday price movements in stock prices were also established with help of horary charts of market. Horary charts of markets were erected for daily opening bell time of markets, and readings were made accordingly like that of reading of any horary chart. This methodology astrological analysis has been discussed in chapter 'Opening bell chart of stock market'."}, "1491": {"doc_id": "astro_f3d08781", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. al analysis has been discussed in chapter 'Opening bell chart of stock market'. Significations of twelve Bhavas of opening bell chart were established and various effects of Grahas situated in various Bhavas on stock prices were also studied accordingly. All these findings and systematic application of these methodologies were elaborately discussed in chapters named '12 stock market Bhavas in opening bell chart' and 'Reading opening bell chart'."}, "1492": {"doc_id": "astro_fcd4b5d0", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. 12 stock market Bhavas in opening bell chart' and 'Reading opening bell chart'. In addition to principles of planetary horas in determining timing of intensified influence of Grahas on stock prices and market sectors, methodology for timing of price movements in stock prices were also studied and established with help of micro projection of Vimshottari Dasha system, which has been explained in chapter 'Grah Dashas in opening bell chart'."}, "1493": {"doc_id": "astro_af49badb", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ystem, which has been explained in chapter 'Grah Dashas in opening bell chart'. Stock Market Astrology - 9 - Sectors of stock market Guru is karaka of yellow metal, gold, and hence cycles of Guru aspected by Rahu and Ketu influence market price of gold. This correlation of Guru cycle with gold price cycles is established and explained in chapter 'Astrological analysis of gold price cycles', with help of historical evidences in support of principle used in determining this correlation. Similarly, Ketu and Sani are karaka of viscous and volatile fluid of energy, crude oil or fossil fuel."}, "1494": {"doc_id": "astro_c9ff5d0b", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. i are karaka of viscous and volatile fluid of energy, crude oil or fossil fuel. Hence transit of Sani aspected by Ketu influences price movements in crude oil prices in markets. This correlation of Sani - Ketu aspects with prices of crude oil is established and explained in chapter 'Astrological analysis of crude oil price cycles'. Importance of Muhrat trading during Diwali day in India has also been taken into consideration."}, "1495": {"doc_id": "astro_0cdb59f8", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. hrat trading during Diwali day in India has also been taken into consideration. As Deepawali marks beginning of a new Samvat calendar or new business year, hence it is considered auspicious by investors and traders to buy or trade on this particular day in stock markets. Therefore one hour Muhrat trading session, usually in evening of Diwali day, is conducted every year by stock exchanges in India to celebrate this auspicious trading session."}, "1496": {"doc_id": "astro_b81a562d", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. year by stock exchanges in India to celebrate this auspicious trading session. A good or a bad omen is attached to positive or negative closing of this special trading session, as such a brief analysis of Muhrat trading session with its implication on stock markets has been discussed in chapter 'Diwali Muhrat trading; annual trend indicator for stock markets'. Hence, by analyzing stock markets with different principles of astrology, it was concluded that science of astrology is perhaps only discipline which is capable of predicting price movements in stock prices with greater accuracy."}, "1497": {"doc_id": "astro_f75370c5", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. is capable of predicting price movements in stock prices with greater accuracy. Business cycles and periods of economic recession and boom can also be successfully determined in advance with use of these astrological principles. Many such principles of astrology have been discussed in this book, after thoroughly analyzing them with help of historical price data of markets, with hope that these principles can be helpful for both traders and analysts of stock markets, as well as for anyone interested in further research on stock markets."}, "1498": {"doc_id": "astro_1df7b03a", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. markets, as well as for anyone interested in further research on stock markets. Chapter 3 Sectors of stock market Sectors of stock markets are various sections of market under which all stocks of market are classified into, depending upon nature of stock and field of business it has been engaged upon. This classification of stocks of any stock market makes study of market much easier and comprehensive in nature, thus facilitating study of large number of stocks of entire market within a limited span of time."}, "1499": {"doc_id": "astro_552ee914", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. study of large number of stocks of entire market within a limited span of time. As we all know how important is time in stock market Stock Market Astrology - 10 - Grahas and market sectors trading, and lot many analysis had to be done or lot many decisions had to be made within a fraction of time, 'time lost is money lost' holds true in stock market trading."}, "1500": {"doc_id": "astro_208fce79", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. fraction of time, 'time lost is money lost' holds true in stock market trading. Following are some major sectors of stock market, which we will study in details in next few chapters of this book: 1) agriculture & agro industries 16) infrastructure 2) automobile 17) IT 3) aviation 18) leather & footwear 4) banking & financial 19) media & entertainment 5) capital goods 20) metal 6) cement 21) paints 7) crude oil & gas 22) pharmaceutical 8) eatable oil 23) power 9) educational 24) publication 10) essential oils and perfumeries 25) realty 11) exports 26) shipping 12) FMCG [fast moving consumer goo"}, "1501": {"doc_id": "astro_92aeb8c5", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. rfumeries 25) realty 11) exports 26) shipping 12) FMCG [fast moving consumer goods] 27) sugar 13) gems & jewelry 28) telecommunication 14) health care 29) textile 15) hospitality 30) travel & tourism Chapter 4 Grahas and market sectors Grahas are heavenly bodies which revolve around Surya, but in astrology we use this term commonly for all Grahas along with Surya and Chandr as well. Thus by term Graha we mean all those heavenly bodies that exert their influence on earth, its creatures and anything or activity related to civilization here on earth."}, "1502": {"doc_id": "astro_4abf5cc4", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. , its creatures and anything or activity related to civilization here on earth. Even Rahu and Ketu, North and South Nodes respectively, are termed as Grahas in astrology, as their influences are also taken into account while making any study and reaching into any prediction through astrology. Hence it has to be very first or basic step to learn about Grahas and their significations concerning stock markets, before making any advanced studies in this field. Following are twelve Grahas and their significations concerning stock markets: 1) Surya ?"}, "1503": {"doc_id": "astro_04357f24", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. are twelve Grahas and their significations concerning stock markets: 1) Surya ? It rules Simha, exalted in Mesha, falls in Tula (detriment in Kumbha). ? Its friends are Chandr, Mangal and Guru. ? Its enemies are Sukr and Sani. ? It is neutral to Budh. Stock Market Astrology - 11 - Grahas and market sectors ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: ? Power sector, media, nuclear energy, Gov. public sector units. ? It has affinity to following commodities and metals of markets: ? Gold, copper, bronze, gun metal, garnet, ruby, firearms, wheat, explosives, graphite & sulpher."}, "1504": {"doc_id": "astro_9240dbf4", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. onze, gun metal, garnet, ruby, firearms, wheat, explosives, graphite & sulpher. 2) Chandr ? It rules Karkataka, exalted in Vrisabha, falls in Vrisabha (detriment in Makara). ? Its friends are Surya and Budh. ? Its enemies are none. ? It is neutral to all others. ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: ? Petroleum, shipping, oil & gas. ? It has affinity to following commodities and metals of markets: ? Mineral water, soft drink, cold drink, milk, milk produces, silver, aluminum, pearl, oil, peppermint, alcohol & rice. 3) Mangal ?"}, "1505": {"doc_id": "astro_a18c4d7a", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. produces, silver, aluminum, pearl, oil, peppermint, alcohol & rice. 3) Mangal ? It rules Mesha and Vrisabha, exalted in Makara, falls in Karkataka (detriment in Tula). ? Its friends are Surya, Chandr and Guru. ? Its enemy is Budh. ? It is neutral to Sukr and Sani. ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: ? Health care, capital goods, automobiles, pharmaceuticals, cements, infrastructure, steel & metals sector. ? It has affinity to following commodities and metals of markets: ? Copper, steel, crude oil, coral, gun powder, firearms, explosives, spices, cloves & tobaccos. 4) Budh ?"}, "1506": {"doc_id": "astro_ff3584eb", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. , coral, gun powder, firearms, explosives, spices, cloves & tobaccos. 4) Budh ? It rules Mithuna and Kanya, exalted in Kanya, falls in Mina (detriment in Dhanur). ? Its friends are Surya and Sukr. ? Its enemy is Chandr. ? It is neutral to Mangal, Guru and Sani. ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: ? Telecommunication, FMCG, textile, IT, educational, banking & financial, insurance, publication & aviation sector. ? It has affinity to following commodities and metals of markets: Stock Market Astrology - 12 - Grahas and market sectors ?"}, "1507": {"doc_id": "astro_7c8b2ce2", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. nd metals of markets: Stock Market Astrology - 12 - Grahas and market sectors ? Peppermint, emerald, agro products, food grains, paper, newsprint & cotton. 5) Guru ? It rules Dhanur and Mina, exalted in Karkataka, falls in Makara (detriment in Mithuna). ? Its friends are Surya, Chandr and Mangal. ? Its enemies are Budh and Sukr. ? It is neutral to Sani. ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: ? Banking & financial, insurance, gems & jewelry, eatable oils, FMCG, textile, shipping & exports sector. ? It has affinity to following commodities and metals of markets: ?"}, "1508": {"doc_id": "astro_2480fee5", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. rts sector. ? It has affinity to following commodities and metals of markets: ? Gold, copper, bronze, food grains, oils, topaz, mustard & wheat. 6) Sukr ? It rules Vrisabha and Tula, exalted in Mina, falls in Kanya (detriment in Mesha). ? Its friends are Budh and Sani. ? Its enemies are Surya and Chandr. ? It is neutral to Mangal and Guru. ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: ? Diamond, gems & jewelry, fashion, media & entertainment, essential oils, hospitality, travel & tourism, FMCG, banking & finance, garments, hotels, sugar & agriculture sectors."}, "1509": {"doc_id": "astro_a7ec2ec7", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ourism, FMCG, banking & finance, garments, hotels, sugar & agriculture sectors. ? It has affinity to following commodities and metals of markets: ? Diamond, opal, quartz, crystal, silver, copper, peppermint & essential oils. 7) Sani ? It rules Makara and Kumbha, exalted in Tula, falls in Mesha (detriment in Karkataka). ? Its friends are Budh and Sukr. ? Its enemies are Surya, Chandr and Mangal. ? It is neutral to Guru. ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: ?"}, "1510": {"doc_id": "astro_6e8b0e83", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ? It is neutral to Guru. ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: ? Cements, infrastructure, iron & steels, leather & footwear, crude oil & gas, coal, mining, metals, realty & agriculture sectors. ? It has affinity to following commodities and metals of markets: ? Tin, iron, steel, coal, leather & crude oils. Stock Market Astrology - 13 - Grahas and market sectors 8) Rahu (North Node) ? It is exalted in Vrisabha and falls in Vrisabha. ? Its friends are Budh, Sukr and Sani. ? Its enemies are Surya, Chandr and Guru. ? It is neutral to Mangal."}, "1511": {"doc_id": "astro_fc7c9d7f", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. and Sani. ? Its enemies are Surya, Chandr and Guru. ? It is neutral to Mangal. ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: ? Media & entertainment, telecommunication, power, electrical goods, realty, infrastructure, cements & metals sector. ? It has affinity to following commodities and metals of markets: ? Iron & steel. 9) Ketu (South Node) ? It is exalted in Vrisabha and falls in Vrisabha. ? Its friends are Budh, Sukr and Sani. ? Its enemies are Surya, Chandr and Guru. ? It is neutral to Mangal. ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: ?"}, "1512": {"doc_id": "astro_031980fd", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. It is neutral to Mangal. ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: ? Power, IT, leather & footwear, crude oils, oil & gas, pharmaceuticals, coal, realty, infrastructure & automobiles sector. ? It has affinity to following commodities and metals of markets: ? Crude oils, coal, copper, iron & steel. [Mathew 7:7: Ask, and it shall be given you; seek, and ye shall find; knock, and it shall be opened unto you. KJV Bible] 10) Uranus ? It rules Kumbha, exalted in Vrisabha, falls in Vrisabha and detriment in Simha. ? Its friends are Budh, Sukr and Sani."}, "1513": {"doc_id": "astro_3ce33bdb", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. alls in Vrisabha and detriment in Simha. ? Its friends are Budh, Sukr and Sani. ? Its enemies are Surya, Chandr and Mangal. ? It is neutral to Guru. ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: ? Telecommunication, IT, metals, iron and steel, oil & gas, soft drinks, aviation, alcohol & nuclear energy sector. ? It has affinity to following commodities and metals of markets: ? Iron, steel, radium, uranium & crude oils. 11) Neptune ? It rules Mina, exalted in Simha, falls in Kumbha and detriment in Kanya. ? Its friends are Surya, Chandr and Budh. ? Its enemies are not well established."}, "1514": {"doc_id": "astro_7b2beb32", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. Its friends are Surya, Chandr and Budh. ? Its enemies are not well established. ? It is neutral to all others. ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: Stock Market Astrology - 14 - Ruling Rasis ? Shipping, oil & gas, pharmaceutical, FMCG, insurance & exports sector. ? It has affinity to following commodities and metals of markets: ? Ethanol, methanol, alcohol, mineral water, soft drink & cold drinks. 12) Pluto ? It rules Vrisabha, exalted in Karkataka, falls in Makara and detriment in Vrisabha. ? Its friends are not well established yet. ? Its enemies are not well established yet."}, "1515": {"doc_id": "astro_cedf5b83", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. iends are not well established yet. ? Its enemies are not well established yet. ? Its neutrality is also not well established yet. ? It rules over following sectors of stock markets: ? Nuclear energy, pharmaceuticals, health care & metals sector. ? It has affinity to following commodities and metals of markets: ? Iron and steel, uranium & radium. [Uranus (Herschel), Neptune and Pluto are NOT used in Jyotish. Surya rules gold in western astrology. Neither is ?detriment? used in Jyotish, but moolatrikona;"}, "1516": {"doc_id": "astro_a60db035", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. in western astrology. Neither is ?detriment? used in Jyotish, but moolatrikona; not same] Chapter 5 Ruling Rasis and market sectors There are 12 Rasis of zodiac, which rule upon different sectors of stock markets. Zodiac is divided into 12 parts of 30? each, and each part has been assigned a Rasi to it. Transiting Grahas through each of these Rasis exert different kind of influence to stock markets and to different sectors of market."}, "1517": {"doc_id": "astro_de124438", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ifferent kind of influence to stock markets and to different sectors of market. After learning about Grahas and their significations concerning stock markets, next is to learn about 12 different Rasis of zodiac and their significations concerning various sectors of stock markets: 1) Mesha ? Ruler Mangal. ? Direction East. ? Nature Fire, cardinal, extrovert. ? Benefics Surya, Mangal, Chandr and Guru. ? Malefics Budh and Sukr. ? Neutral Sani. ? Market sectors ?"}, "1518": {"doc_id": "astro_a2f773d3", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. , Chandr and Guru. ? Malefics Budh and Sukr. ? Neutral Sani. ? Market sectors ? automobiles, pharmaceuticals, infrastructure, capital goods, health care, hospitals, diagnostic centers, medical & surgical equipment, limestone, Stock Market Astrology - 15 - Ruling Rasis gypsum, cement, iron & steel, crude, spices, copper, tobaccos, firearms, explosives & metals. 2) Vrisabha ? Ruler Sukr. ? Direction South. ? Nature Earth, fixed, introvert. ? Benefics Surya, Budh, Sukr and Sani. ? Malefics Chandr and Guru. ? Neutral Mangal. ? Market sectors ?"}, "1519": {"doc_id": "astro_a20ae546", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. Sukr and Sani. ? Malefics Chandr and Guru. ? Neutral Mangal. ? Market sectors ? Banking, finance, FMCG, entertainment, hotels, hospitality, media, sugar, agriculture, cosmetics, essential oils, perfumeries, peppermint, confectionaries, jewelry, garments, diamond, silver, copper, paints, amusement parks, tourism, toys, investments and insurance. 3) Mithuna ? Ruler Budh. ? Direction West. ? Nature Air, mutable, extrovert. ? Benefics Budh, Sukr and Sani. ? Malefics Surya, Mangal and Guru. ? Neutral Chandr. ? Market sectors ?"}, "1520": {"doc_id": "astro_2f668826", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. d Sani. ? Malefics Surya, Mangal and Guru. ? Neutral Chandr. ? Market sectors ? Telecommunications, media, mobiles, export, insurance, airlines, banking, FMCG, publications, IT, textile, peppermint, agro products, food grains, cotton, paper, newsprint and internet services. 4) Karkataka ? Ruler Chandr. ? Direction North. ? Nature Water, cardinal, introvert. ? Benefics Chandr, Mangal and Guru. ? Malefics Surya, Budh and Sukr. ? Neutral Sani. ? Market sectors ?"}, "1521": {"doc_id": "astro_aa3fca3d", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. l and Guru. ? Malefics Surya, Budh and Sukr. ? Neutral Sani. ? Market sectors ? Oil & gas, petroleum, mineral water, shipping, milk & dairy products, pearl, silver, aluminum, peppermint, alcohols, cold drinks, soft drinks & rice grain. 5) Simha ? Ruler Surya. ? Direction East. ? Nature Fire, fixed, extrovert. ? Benefics Surya, Mangal, and Guru. Stock Market Astrology - 16 - Ruling Rasis ? Malefics Chandr, Budh and Sukr. ? Neutral Sani. ? Market sectors ? Power, media, gold, copper, bronze, nuclear energy, weapons of mass destruction, gunmetal, firearms, explosives, graphite, sulpher & wheat."}, "1522": {"doc_id": "astro_76bd79ad", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. of mass destruction, gunmetal, firearms, explosives, graphite, sulpher & wheat. 6) Kanya ? Ruler Budh. ? Direction South. ? Nature Earth, mutable, introvert. ? Benefics Budh, Sukr and Sani. ? Malefics Surya, Mangal, Chandr and Guru. ? Market sectors ? Media, telecommunication, mobiles, exports, insurance, aviation, banking, finance, FMCG, publications, it, textile, peppermint, agro products, food grains, cotton, paper, newsprint and internet services. 7) Tula ? Ruler Sukr. ? Direction West. ? Nature Air, cardinal, extrovert. ? Benefics Budh, Sukr and Sani. ? Malefics Surya, Chandr and Guru."}, "1523": {"doc_id": "astro_1911eb82", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. , extrovert. ? Benefics Budh, Sukr and Sani. ? Malefics Surya, Chandr and Guru. ? Neutral Mangal. ? Market sectors ? Banking, finance, investments., insurance, FMCG, media, entertainment, hotels, hospitality, sugar, agriculture, cosmetics, essential oils, perfumeries, peppermint, confectionaries, jewelries, garments, diamond, silver, copper, paints, amusement parks, toys, tourism & travel. 8) Vrisabha ? Ruler Mangal. ? Direction North. ? Nature Water, fixed, introvert. ? Benefics Surya, Chandr, Mangal and Guru. ? Malefics Budh and Sukr. ? Neutral Sani. ? Market sectors ?"}, "1524": {"doc_id": "astro_3b9777a8", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. , Mangal and Guru. ? Malefics Budh and Sukr. ? Neutral Sani. ? Market sectors ? Automobile, pharmaceutical, infrastructure, capital goods, health care, hospitals, medical equipment, diagnostic centers, iron & steel, gypsum, cement, limestone, metals, copper, crude, spices, tobacco, nuclear power, uranium, radium, firearms & explosives. Stock Market Astrology - 17 - Ruling Rasis 9) Dhanur ? Ruler Guru. ? Direction East. ? Nature Fire, mutable, extrovert. ? Benefics Surya, Mangal and Guru. ? Malefics Chandr, Budh, Sukr and Sani. ? Market sectors ?"}, "1525": {"doc_id": "astro_2d5c3117", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ya, Mangal and Guru. ? Malefics Chandr, Budh, Sukr and Sani. ? Market sectors ? Insurance, banking, financial, FMCG, bronze, gold, textile, eatable oils, exports, shipping, jewelry, garments, wheat, mustard & food grains. 10) Makara ? Ruler Sani. ? Direction South. ? Nature Earth, cardinal, introvert. ? Benefics Budh, Sukr and Sani. ? Malefics Surya, Chandr and Guru. ? Neutral Mangal. ? Market sectors ? Leather, footwear, realty, infrastructure, oil & gas, cement, metals, iron & steel, mining, coal, gypsum, tin, limestone, agriculture & livestock. 11) Kumbha ? Ruler Sani. ? Direction West."}, "1526": {"doc_id": "astro_fa05a729", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. limestone, agriculture & livestock. 11) Kumbha ? Ruler Sani. ? Direction West. ? Nature Air, fixed, extrovert. ? Benefics Surya, Budh, Sukr and Sani. ? Malefics Chandr and Guru. ? Neutral Mangal. ? Market sectors ? Leather, footwear, realty, infrastructure, oil & gas, cement, metals, iron & steel, mining, coal, gypsum, tin, limestone, telecommunication, internet, nuclear power, uranium, radium, soft & cold drinks, alcohols, aviation, agriculture and livestock. 12) Mina ? Ruler Guru. ? Direction North. ? Nature Water, mutable, introvert. ? Benefics Chandr, Mangal and Guru."}, "1527": {"doc_id": "astro_c19c2e50", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. North. ? Nature Water, mutable, introvert. ? Benefics Chandr, Mangal and Guru. ? Malefics Surya, Budh, Sukr and Sani. ? Market sectors ? Insurance, banking, financial, FMCG, bronze, gold, textile, eatable oils, exports, shipping, jewelry, garments, oil & gas, pharmaceutical, Stock Market Astrology - 18 - Sector wise predicting methanol, ethanol, alcohols, soft & cold drinks, mineral water, wheat, mustard & food grains. Chapter 6 Sector wise predicting intraday, short & long term market outlook 6.1 Agriculture & agro industries sector Intraday ?"}, "1528": {"doc_id": "astro_2af7feb4", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. & long term market outlook 6.1 Agriculture & agro industries sector Intraday ? Intraday buying in this sector emerges when Budh, Sukr and Sani are aspected by benefic Grahas and Chandr transits through Vrisabha, Mithuna, Kanya, Tula, Makara, Kumbha, Bharani, Pushya, Ashlesha, Purva Phalguni, Anuradha, Jyeshtha, Purva Ashada, Uttara Bhadra and Revati."}, "1529": {"doc_id": "astro_a66fa20a", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ha, Purva Phalguni, Anuradha, Jyeshtha, Purva Ashada, Uttara Bhadra and Revati. ? Whereas, intraday selling in this sector emerges when same Grahas are aspected by malefic Grahas and Chandr transits through Vrisabha, Mithuna, Kanya, Tula, Makara, Kumbha, Bharani, Pushya, Ashlesha, Purva Phalguni, Anuradha, Jyeshtha, Purva Ashada, Uttara Bhadra and Revati. Short term ?"}, "1530": {"doc_id": "astro_c8747f6b", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. lguni, Anuradha, Jyeshtha, Purva Ashada, Uttara Bhadra and Revati. Short term ? Short term buying in this sector emerges when Budh, Sukr and Sani are aspected by benefic Grahas and Surya transits through Vrisabha, Mithuna, Kanya, Tula, Makara, Kumbha, Bharani, Pushya, Ashlesha, Purva Phalguni, Anuradha, Jyeshtha, Purva Ashada, Uttara Bhadra and Revati."}, "1531": {"doc_id": "astro_6a1c9b02", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading.