e predicting 6.2 Automobile sector Intraday ? Intraday buying in this sector emerges when Mangal and Ketu are aspected by benefic Grahas and Chandr transits through Mesha, Vrisabha, Mrigashira, Chitra, Dhanishtha, Ashwini, Magha and Moola. ? Whereas, intraday selling in this sector emerges when same Grahas are aspected by malefic Grahas and Chandr transits through Mesha, Vrisabha, Mrigashira, Chitra, Dhanishtha, Ashwini, Magha and Moola. Short term ?"}, "1535": {"doc_id": "astro_a21ee37c", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. risabha, Mrigashira, Chitra, Dhanishtha, Ashwini, Magha and Moola. Short term ? Short term buying in this sector emerges when Mangal and Ketu are aspected by benefic Grahas and Surya transits through Mesha, Vrisabha, Mrigashira, Chitra, Dhanishtha, Ashwini, Magha and Moola. ? Whereas, short term selling in this sector emerges when same Grahas are aspected by malefic Grahas and Surya transits through Mesha, Vrisabha, Mrigashira, Chitra, Dhanishtha, Ashwini, Magha and Moola. Long term ?"}, "1536": {"doc_id": "astro_e2018c69", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. Vrisabha, Mrigashira, Chitra, Dhanishtha, Ashwini, Magha and Moola. Long term ? Long term buying in this sector emerges when Mangal and Ketu are aspected by benefic Grahas and Guru transits through Mesha, Vrisabha, Mrigashira, Chitra, Dhanishtha, Ashwini, Magha and Moola. ? Whereas, long term selling in this sector emerges when same Grahas are aspected by malefic Grahas and Guru transits through Mesha, Vrisabha, Mrigashira, Chitra, Dhanishtha, Ashwini, Magha and Moola. 6.3 Aviation sector Intraday ?"}, "1537": {"doc_i