fluence can be determined through aspects that a Graha receives from other Grahas. Conjunction ? When two Grahas pass through same longitude in a same Rasi is said to be in conjunction to each other. Semi-square ? When two Grahas are 45?"}, "1879": {"doc_id": "astro_976a9755", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. said to be in conjunction to each other. Semi-square ? When two Grahas are 45? apart from each other, then mutual aspect between them is called semi-square. Semi-sextile ? When two Grahas are 30? or one Rasi apart from each other, then mutual aspect between them is known as semi-sextile. Sextile ? When two Grahas are 60? or two Rasis apart from each other, then mutual aspect between them is called sextile. Square ? When two Grahas are 90? or three Rasis apart from each other, then mutual aspect between them is called square. Trine ? When two Grahas are 120?"}, "1880": {"doc_id": "astro_bef0247c", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. n mutual aspect between them is called square. Trine ? When two Grahas are 120? or four Rasis apart from each other, then mutual aspect between them is known as trine. Semi-quadrate ? When two Grahas are 135? or four and a half Rasis apart from each other, then mutual aspect between them is called to be semi-quadrate. Opposition ? When two Grahas are 180? or six Rasis apart from each other or opposite to each other, then mutual aspect between them is known as opposition. All above mentioned aspects have different strengths of influence."}, "1881": {"doc_id": "astro_152d3193", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. opposition. All above mentioned aspects have different strengths of influence. Most powerful of all aspects are conjunctions and oppositions. Next to conjunctions and oppositions, other powerful aspects are square, trine and sextile. Remaining other aspects does not influence much strength to any result. Stock Market Astrology - 88 - Practical strategies of intraday trading Chapter 10 Practical strategies of intraday trading with Hora - planetary hours A solar day is divided into 24 hours and each hour of day is assigned to a Graha, beginning right from sunrise to next sunrise."}, "1882": {"doc_id": "astro_af9096db", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ur of day is assigned to a Graha, beginning right from sunrise to next sunrise. A Graha is studied to have its impact on few particular hours of a day on every weekday. Hour or Hora of any Graha can be determined by using chart given on next page, applying it from time of sunrise on any particular day. For example, first hour from time of sunrise on Sunday is assigned to Surya, and next hour is assigned to Sukr and likewise till next sunrise."}, "1883": {"doc_id": "astro_11abdfb8", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ned to Surya, and next hour is assigned to Sukr and likewise till next sunrise. While on, Friday first hour from time of sunrise has been assigned to Sukr, and next hour is assigned to Budh and likewise till next sunrise, as described in table given on next page. During market hours of any stock markets, Grahas which rules over a particular Hora, determines influence on prices of stocks of those sectors, which a Graha exerts its influence upon, depending on strength of that particular Graha and aspects of other Grahas upon it, on that particular day."}, "1884": {"doc_id": "astro_e54a1612", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. t particular Graha and aspects of other Grahas upon it, on that particular day. Tactful application of Hora, together with consideration of planetary transits, serves as an important tool for intraday trading in stock markets. When Hora of a Graha runs, then sectors under influence of that Graha experience a sudden positive or negative movement in prices, depending on benefic or malefic aspects that Graha receives from other Grahas, on that particular day. Usually stock markets are open for five days a week, i.e. Monday to Friday, but in some cases, they are open on Saturday too."}, "1885": {"doc_id": "astro_b25e7eb8", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. week, i.e. Monday to Friday, but in some cases, they are open on Saturday too. Commodity markets are open for six days a week, from Monday to Saturday. Therefore I have given Hora chart for all seven days of week and influence of each Hora on financial markets are explained here. How to use Hora for profitable intraday trading in stock markets is also explained in detail."}, "1886": {"doc_id": "astro_f13a0cc8", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. a for profitable intraday trading in stock markets is also explained in detail. Stock Market Astrology - 89 - Practical strategies of intraday trading Hora chart Hora Sun Mon Tue Wed Thu Fri Sat 1 Surya Chandr Mangal Budh Guru Sukr Sani 2 Sukr Sani Surya Chandr Mangal Budh Guru 3 Budh Guru Sukr Sani Surya Chandr Mangal 4 Chandr Mangal Budh Guru Sukr Sani Surya 5 Sani Surya Chandr Mangal Budh Guru Sukr 6 Guru Sukr Sani Surya Chandr Mangal Budh 7 Mangal Budh Guru Sukr Sani Surya Chandr 8 Surya Chandr Mangal Budh Guru Sukr Sani 9 Sukr Sani Surya Chandr Mangal Budh Guru 10 Budh Guru Sukr Sani Sury"}, "1887": {"doc_id": "astro_525f644f", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. Sukr Sani 9 Sukr Sani Surya Chandr Mangal Budh Guru 10 Budh Guru Sukr Sani Surya Chandr Mangal 11 Chandr Mangal Budh Guru Sukr Sani Surya 12 Sani Surya Chandr Mangal Budh Guru Sukr 13 Guru Sukr Sani Surya Chandr Mangal Budh 14 Mangal Budh Guru Sukr Sani Surya Chandr 15 Surya Chandr Mangal Budh Guru Sukr Sani 16 Sukr Sani Surya Chandr Mangal Budh Guru 17 Budh Guru Sukr Sani Surya Chandr Mangal 18 Chandr Mangal Budh Guru Sukr Sani Surya 19 Sani Surya Chandr Mangal Budh Guru Sukr 20 Guru Sukr Sani Surya Chandr Mangal Budh 21 Mangal Budh Guru Sukr Sani Surya Chandr 22 Surya Chandr Mangal Budh Gur"}, "1888": {"doc_id": "astro_3ebf91d4", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. Budh 21 Mangal Budh Guru Sukr Sani Surya Chandr 22 Surya Chandr Mangal Budh Guru Sukr Sani 23 Sukr Sani Surya Chandr Mangal Budh Guru 24 Budh Guru Sukr Sani Surya Chandr Mangal 10.1 Intraday trading strategy for Surya Hora ? If Surya is aspected by Chandr, Mangal or Guru, then gold, copper, bronze as well as power and media sector stocks surge up in Hora of Surya, hence buying in these stocks before beginning of this Hora gives profitable returns. ? Whereas, if Surya is aspected by Sukr, Rahu or Sani, then selling in above stocks during this Hora earns desired profit to traders."}, "1889": {"doc_id": "astro_326f2ead", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. then selling in above stocks during this Hora earns desired profit to traders. Practical application in intraday trading On 29.09.2009, Tuesday, sunrise time was 05:52 (am). Stock Market Astrology - 90 - Practical strategies of intraday trading Therefore from given Hora chart we get Surya Hora from 13:52 to 14:52. This day Surya was aspected by Chandr, Mangal, Guru and Rahu. By judging aspects, we found that favorable aspects to Surya are stronger, so it was decided to trade long in stocks related to power and media during this Hora."}, "1890": {"doc_id": "astro_9ddea234", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. as decided to trade long in stocks related to power and media during this Hora. Therefore Tata Power was purchased with starting of Surya Hora at Rs. 1290 per share at 13:52, and sold at end of Surya Hora at 14:52, at Rs. 1306, with profit of Rs. 16 per share or 1.25 % profit within one hour of trading. Tata Power: 29th Sep 2009 ZEEL was purchased with starting of Surya Hora at Rs. 233 per share at 13:52, and sold at end of Surya Hora at 14:52, at Rs. 235.50, with profit of Rs. 2.50 per share or 1.10 % profit within one hour of trading."}, "1891": {"doc_id": "astro_7a4c4ded", "d