 09:57, and sold at end of Chandr Hora at 10:52, at Rs. 2161, with profit of Rs. 15 per share or 0.70 % profit within one hour of trading. Reliance: 29th Sep 2009 On 30.09.2009, Wednesday, sunrise time was 05:52. Therefore from given Hora chart we get Chandr Hora from 13:52 to 14:52. This day Chandr was aspected by Surya, Guru, Mangal and Rahu."}, "1894": {"doc_id": "astro_8759bcf3", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. m 13:52 to 14:52. This day Chandr was aspected by Surya, Guru, Mangal and Rahu. By judging aspects, we found that favorable aspects to Chandr are stronger, so it was decided to trade long in stocks related to crude during this Hora. Therefore RIL was purchased with starting of Chandr Hora at Rs. 2199 per share at 13:52, and sold at end of Chandr Hora at 14:52, at Rs. 2209, with profit of Rs. 10 per share or 0.45 % profit within one hour of trading."}, "1895": {"doc_id": "astro_5e7e4625", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. 9, with profit of Rs. 10 per share or 0.45 % profit within one hour of trading. Stock Market Astrology - 92 - Practical strategies of intraday trading Reliance: 30th Sep 2009 RPL was purchased with starting of Chandr Hora at Rs. 129.60 per share at 13:52, and sold at end of Chandr Hora at 14:52, at Rs. 131, with profit of Rs. 1.40 per share or 1.10 % profit within one hour of trading. RPL: 30th Sep 2009 10.3 Intraday trading strategy for Mangal Hora ?"}, "1896": {"doc_id": "astro_e89f5741", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. of trading. RPL: 30th Sep 2009 10.3 Intraday trading strategy for Mangal Hora ? If Mangal is aspected by Surya, Chandr or Guru, then prices of copper, steel, metal, spices, pharmaceutical, health care, automobile, crude oil, capital goods, cement and infrastructure sector stocks move up in Hora of Mangal, hence buying in these stocks before beginning of this Hora gives profitable returns to traders. ? Whereas, selling in above stocks during this Hora earns desired profits to traders, if Mangal is aspected by Budh, Rahu or Sani."}, "1897": {"doc_id": "astro_2f0df52b", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. earns desired profits to traders, if Mangal is aspected by Budh, Rahu or Sani. Practical application in intraday trading On 29.09.2009, Tuesday, sunrise time was 05:52. Therefore from given Hora chart we get Mangal Hora from 12:52 to 13:52. This day Mangal was aspected by Sani. Stock Market Astrology - 93 - Practical strategies of intraday trading By judging aspects we found that aspect to Mangal is unfavorable, so it was decided to trade short in stocks related to infrastructure, steel and realty during this Hora. DLF: 29th Sep 2009 Therefore DLF was short sold at Rs."}, "1898": {"doc_id": "astro_9f82455c", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. realty during this Hora. DLF: 29th Sep 2009 Therefore DLF was short sold at Rs. 431 per share with starting of this Hora at 12:52, and purchased back at end of Mangal Hora at 13:52, at Rs. 429, with profit of Rs. 2 per share or 0.45 % profit within one hour of trading. Unitech was short sold at Rs. 109.50 per share with starting of this Hora at 12:52, and purchased back at end of Sani Hora at 13:52, at Rs. 108.60, with profit of Rs. 0.90 per share or 0.80 % profit within one hour of trading."}, "1899": {"doc_id": "astro_4a1177a2", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. with profit of Rs. 0.90 per share or 0.80 % profit within one hour of trading. Unitech: 29th Sep 2009 Stock Market Astrology - 94 - Practical strategies of intraday trading Jindal Steel: 29th Sep 2009 Jindal Steel was short sold at Rs. 597 per share with starting of this Hora at 12:52, and purchased back at end of Sani Hora at 13:52, at Rs. 592, with profit of Rs. 5 per share or 0.85 % profit within one hour of trading. 10.4 Intraday trading strategy for Budh Hora ?"}, "1900": {"doc_id": "astro_17fbb999", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ofit within one hour of trading. 10.4 Intraday trading strategy for Budh Hora ? If Budh is aspected by Surya or Sukr, then stock prices of telecommunication, FMCG, food grains, cotton, paper, newsprint, peppermint, agro products, insurance, textile, exports, aviation, IT, banking and financial, media, advertising, educational and publication sector stocks surge up during Hora of Budh, hence buying in these stocks before beginning of this Hora gives profitable returns for traders."}, "1901": {"doc_id": "astro_273d2706", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. hese stocks before beginning of this Hora gives profitable returns for traders. ? Whereas, if Budh is aspected by Chandr or Mangal, then selling in above stocks during this Hora earns considerable amount of profits to traders. Practical application in intraday trading On 30.09.2009, Wednesday, sunrise time was 05:52. Therefore from given Hora chart we get Budh Hora from 12:52 to 13:52. This day Budh was aspected by Sukr. By judging aspects, we found that aspect to Budh is favorable, so it was decided to trade long in stocks related to banking during this Hora."}, "1902": {"doc_id": "astro_9ff6859b", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. so it was decided to trade long in stocks related to banking during this Hora. Therefore SBI was purchased with starting of Budh Hora at Rs. 2152 per share at 12:52, and sold at end of Budh Hora at 13:52, at Rs. 2174 with profit of Rs. 22 share or 1.00 % profit within one hour of trading. Stock Market Astrology - 95 - Practical strategies of intraday trading SBI: 30th Sep 2009 ICICI Bank was purchased with starting of Budh Hora at Rs. 885 per share at 12:52, and sold at end of Budh Hora at 13:52, at Rs. 893, with profit of Rs. 8 per share or 0.90 % profit within one hour of trading."}, "1903": {"doc_id": "astro_5ebdeeaa", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. 93, with profit of Rs. 8 per share or 0.90 % profit within one hour of trading. ICICI Bank: 30th Sep 2009 10.5 Intraday trading strategy for Guru Hora ? If Guru is aspected by Surya, Chandr or Mangal, then prices of gold, bronze, food grains, mustard, FMCG, banking & financial, insurance, eatable oils, textile, shipping, exports, gems and jewelry sector stocks surge up in market during Hora of Guru, hence buying these stocks before beginning of this Hora fetches profitable returns for traders."}, "1904": {"doc_id": "astro_da684ba9", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. se stocks before beginning of this Hora fetches profitable returns for traders. ? Whereas, selling in above stocks during this Hora earns profitable returns to traders, if Guru is aspected by Budh, Sukr or Rahu. Practical application in intraday trading On 29.09.2009, Tuesday, sunrise time was 05:52. Therefore from given Hora chart we get Guru Hora from 11:52 to 12:52. This day Guru was aspected by Chandr, Mangal, Rahu and Ketu."}, "1905": {"doc_id": "astro_70b53488", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. om 11:52 to 12:52. This day Guru was aspected by Chandr, Mangal, Rahu and Ketu. Stock Market Astrology - 96 - Practical strategies of intraday trading By judging aspects, we found that unfavorable aspects to Guru are stronger, so it was decided to trade short in stocks related to banking & finance during this Hora. Therefore HDFC Bank was short sold at Rs. 1618 per share with starting of this Hora at 11:52, and purchased back at end of Guru Hora at 12:52, at Rs. 1608, with profit of Rs. 10 per share or 0.60 % profit within one hour of trading."}, "1906": {"doc_id": "astro_1816dfe6", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. 8, with profit of Rs. 10 per share or 0.60 % profit within one hour of trading. HDFC Bank: 29th Sep 2009 PNB was short sold at Rs. 786 per share with starting of this Hora at 11:52, and purchased back at end of Guru Hora at 12:52, at Rs. 781, with profit of Rs. 5 per share or 0.65 % profit within one hour of trading. PNB: 29th Sep 2009 10.6 Intraday trading strategy for Sukr Hora ?"}, "1907": {"doc_id": "astro_23073197", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. r of trading. PNB: 29th Sep 2009 10.6 Intraday trading strategy for Sukr Hora ? If Sukr is aspected by Budh or Sani, then stock prices of silver, copper, diamond, peppermint oil, essential oils, diamond cutting, jewelry, hospitality, hotels, tourism, media & entertainment, FMCG, finance, banking, garments, sugar and agricultural sector stocks surge up during Hora of Sukr, hence buying in these stocks before beginning of this Hora gives profitable returns to traders. Stock Market Astrology - 97 - Practical strategies of intraday trading ?"}, "1908": {"doc_id": "astro_9a27ae28", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. aders. Stock Market Astrology - 97 - Practical strategies of intraday trading ? Whereas, if Sukr is aspected by Surya, Chandr or Mangal, then selling in above stocks during this Hora earns desired profits to traders. Practical application in intraday trading On 29.09.2009, Tuesday, sunrise time was 05:52. Therefore from given Hora chart we get Sukr Hora from 14:52 to 15:52. This day Sukr was aspected by Budh. By judging aspects, we found that aspect to Sukr is strong, so it was decided to trade long in stocks related to banking and sugar during this Hora."}, "1909": {"doc_id": "astro_d0bdcd69", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. decided to trade long in stocks related to banking and sugar during this Hora. Therefore HDFC Bank was purchased with starting of Sukr Hora at Rs. 1605 per share at 14:52, and sold at end of day at 15:25, at Rs. 1617, with profit of Rs. 12 per share or 0.75 % profit within half an hour of trading. HDFC Bank: 29th Sep 2009 Balrampur Chini was purchased with starting of Sukr Hora at Rs. 119.70 per share at 14:52, and sold at end of Sukr Hora at 15:25, at Rs. 120.50, with profit of Rs. 0.80 per share or 0.65 % profit within half an hour of trading."}, "1910": {"doc_id": "astro_fc89a840", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. h profit of Rs. 0.80 per share or 0.65 % profit within half an hour of trading. Balrampur Chini: 29th Sep 2009 Stock Market Astrology - 98 - Practical strategies of intraday trading 10.7 Intraday trading strategy for Sani Hora ? If Sani is aspected by Budh, Sukr or Rahu, then stock prices of oil & gas, cement, realty, infrastructure, iron & steel, metal, mining, coal, agricultural products, leather & footwear sector stocks surge up during Hora of Sani, hence buying in these stocks before beginning of this Hora gives profitable returns to traders."}, "1911": {"doc_id": "astro_846fc07b", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. these stocks before beginning of this Hora gives profitable returns to traders. ? Whereas, selling in above stocks during this Hora earns desired profits to traders, if Sani is aspected by Surya, Chandr or Mangal. Practical application in intraday trading On 29.09.2009, Tuesday, sunrise time was 05:52. Therefore from given Hora chart we get Sani Hora from 10:52 to 11:52. This day Sani was aspected by Surya, Mangal, Guru and Chandr."}, "1912": {"doc_id": "astro_98f6fc8c", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. m 10:52 to 11:52. This day Sani was aspected by Surya, Mangal, Guru and Chandr. By judging aspects, we found that unfavorable aspects to Sani are stronger, so it was decided to trade short in stocks related to steel, infrastructure, realty and cement during this Hora. ACC: 29th Sep 2009 Therefore ACC was short sold at Rs. 823 per share with starting of this Hora at 10:52, and purchased back at end of Sani Hora at 11:52, at Rs. 818, with profit of Rs. 5 per share or 0.60 % profit within one hour of trading."}, "1913": {"doc_id": "astro_9df46444", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. 18, with profit of Rs. 5 per share or 0.60 % profit within one hour of trading. Stock Market Astrology - 99 - Practical strategies of intraday trading Unitech: 29th Sep 2009 Unitech was short sold at Rs. 110.40 per share with starting of this Hora at 10:52, and purchased back at end of Sani Hora at 11:52, at Rs. 109.30, with profit of Rs. 1.10 per share or 1 % profit within one hour of trading. SAIL: 29th Sep 2009 SAIL was short sold at Rs. 171 per share with starting of this Hora at 10:52, and purchased back at end of Sani Hora at 11:52, at Rs. 168.50, with profit of Rs."}, "1914": {"doc_id": "astro_7617026f", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. purchased back at end of Sani Hora at 11:52, at Rs. 168.50, with profit of Rs. 2.50 per share or 1.50 % profit within one hour of trading. Jindal Steel was short sold at Rs. 602 per share with starting of this Hora at 10:52, and purchased back at end of Sani Hora at 11:52, at Rs. 598, with profit of Rs. 4 per share or 0.70 % profit within one hour of trading. Stock Market Astrology - 100 - Opening bell chart of stock market Jindal Steel: 29th Sep 2009 DLF was short sold at Rs. 431 per share with starting of this Hora at 10:52, and purchased back at end of Sani Hora at 11:52, at Rs."}, "1915": {"doc_id": "astro_cc5ae418", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. of this Hora at 10:52, and purchased back at end of Sani Hora at 11:52, at Rs. 429, with profit of Rs. 2 per share or 0.50 % profit within one hour of trading. DLF: 29th Sep 2009 Chapter 11 Opening bell chart of stock market Intraday movements in stock prices or intraday dynamics of stock markets can be studied by casting horoscope chart of market for that day, with time of opening bell of market for particular place (city) where stock market in question is situated. For example, place will be Mumbai for NSE and BSE, London for London Stock Exchange, Tokyo for Nikkei and so on likewise."}, "1916": {"doc_id": "astro_127ddb38", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. and BSE, London for London Stock Exchange, Tokyo for Nikkei and so on likewise. Sign where ascendant falls in opening bell chart of market determines sector where major price movements will happen during day's trade. If benefic Grahas aspect ascendant, then those sectors which Rasi of ascendant represents, will show positive momentum during day and will remain strong."}, "1917": {"doc_id": "astro_01bd0650", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. dant represents, will show positive momentum during day and will remain strong. Stock Market Astrology - 101 - Grah Dashas in opening bell chart Whereas, if malefic Grahas aspect ascendant, then those sectors which Rasi of ascendant represents, will show weakness in stock prices during day and will remain bearish. Similarly results of various Bhavas must also be studied to analyze strength and weakness of various sectors of market, during intraday trade."}, "1918": {"doc_id": "astro_26868385", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. lyze strength and weakness of various sectors of market, during intraday trade. Careful study of horas, planetary hours, along with planetary Dashas or progressions should also be incorporated in analysis to determine timing for decisive movement to come in a particular sector, during market hours. Chapter 12 Grah Dashas in opening bell chart Progressions of Grahas or grah Dashas for opening bell chart of a stock market must be calculated as per table given below, by using sidereal longitude of Chandr in opening bell chart of market."}, "1919": {"doc_id": "astro_407127d1", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. n below, by using sidereal longitude of Chandr in opening bell chart of market. Balance of Dasha table for Vimshottari Dasha Chandr in Chandr's Mes, Sim, Vrb, Kan, Mit, Tul, Kar, Vrk, longitude Dha Mak Kum Min Dg. M. Gr. M. Gr. M. Gr. M. Gr. M. 00 00 Ke 28 Sy 18 Ma 14 Gu 16 03 20 21 12 07 Sa 76 06 40 14 06 Ra 72 57 10 00 07 Ch 40 54 38 13 20 Sk 80 30 36 19 16 40 60 20 18 Bu 68 20 00 40 10 Gu 64 51 23 00 20 Ma 28 48 34 26 40 Sy 24 21 32 17 30 00 18 14 16 00 Dg. = degree (?) / M."}, "1920": {"doc_id": "astro_cd3b7b85", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. 00 20 Ma 28 48 34 26 40 Sy 24 21 32 17 30 00 18 14 16 00 Dg. = degree (?) / M. = minute Stock Market Astrology - 102 - Grah Dashas in opening bell chart Dasha periods of Grahas Sy 24 min Ch 40 min Mal 28 min Ra 72 min Gu 64 min Sa 76 min Bu 68 min Ke 28 min Sk 80 min Calculating Graha Dashas Effects of Grahas, determined by opening bell chart of market, are experienced during periods or Dashas of those Grahas running during market time. Therefore calculation of Dasha periods for each Graha is very important to determine timing of experiencing momentum in any sector of stock markets."}, "1921": {"doc_id": "astro_b106a484", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. nt to determine timing of experiencing momentum in any sector of stock markets. Dasha periods for Grahas can be calculated by using Balance of Dasha table given above in a following manner: Let us calculate Dasha period for NSE, Mumbai, for date 12th Mar 2009, for market opening time of 9:55:00. Here we are using opening bell time for market as 9:55:00, because both Indian stock markets, namely NSE and BSE, open at this time. From opening bell chart of market for 12th Mar 2009 we get following position of Chandr: Chandr Kanya 11? 32?"}, "1922": {"doc_id": "astro_85e6359a", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ket for 12th Mar 2009 we get following position of Chandr: Chandr Kanya 11? 32? By using given Balance of Dasha table, we look into column Chandr in Kanya, corresponding to 10 degree. We get: Chandr in Kanya 10? = 40 min 00 sec By adjusting Chandr's period for 3? 20? = 10 min 00 sec Or [3? x 60? + 20?] 200 min = 10 min 00 sec Or 40 min = 2 min 00 sec Or [2 min x 60 sec] 40 min = 0 min 120 sec Or 4 min = 0 min 12 sec Stock Market Astrology - 103 - 12 stock market Bhavas Now with above derivations we calculate Dasha duration for Chandr in Kanya's longitude 1? 32? or (60? + 32? = 92?) 92? = 40?"}, "1923": {"doc_id": "astro_ff056732", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. duration for Chandr in Kanya's longitude 1? 32? or (60? + 32? = 92?) 92? = 40? x 2 + 4? x 3 = 2 min x 2 + 12 sec x 3 = 4 min 36 sec Now to get Balance of Dasha for Chandr in 11? 32? of Kanya, we deduct 4 min 36 sec (for 1? 32? [above 10?]) from 40 min (for 10? Kanya). We get 35 min 24 sec. Hence balance of Chandr Dasha for Chandr of 11? 32? in Kanya is 35 min 24 sec. This means Dasha of Chandr will run for 35 min 24 sec from time of opening bell of market. Then after Dasha of Mangal will run for 28 min, followed by Rahu Dasha for 72 min and so on, one by one."}, "1924": {"doc_id": "astro_f2f7c57c", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. l will run for 28 min, followed by Rahu Dasha for 72 min and so on, one by one. Lets see how Dasha periods are calculated for various Grahas, on 12th Mar 2009, 9:55:00, (am) Mumbai: Ch (balance 11 min 36 sec) - 09:55:00 to 10:30:24 Ma (28 min) - 10:30:24 to 10:58:24 Ra (72 min) - 10:58:24 to 12:10:24 Gu (64 min) - 12:10:24 to 13:14:24 Sa (76 min) - 13:14:24 to 14:30:24 Bu (68 min) - 14:30:24 to 15:38:24 Ke (28 min) - 15:38:24 to 16:06:24 Chapter 13 12 stock market Bhavas in opening bell chart 12 different Bhavas, of opening bell chart for stock market, represent different sectors of market."}, "1925": {"doc_id": "astro_9e4f22ea", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. of opening bell chart for stock market, represent different sectors of market. Representation or significations of each Bhava for different sectors of stock markets are explained below. Stock Market Astrology - 104 - Reading opening bell chart 1st Bhava Public sector units and power sectors. 2nd Bhava FMCG, banking, finance, insurance, jewelry, gold, eatable oils, food grains, soft & cold drink sectors. 3rd Bhava Internet, telecommunication, mobiles, media, publications, newsprint, IT and automobile sectors."}, "1926": {"doc_id": "astro_b5aa68b8", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. munication, mobiles, media, publications, newsprint, IT and automobile sectors. 4th Bhava Agriculture, agro products, crude, oil & gas, cements, metals, iron & steel, realty, mining and infrastructure sectors. 5th Bhava Entertainment, amusement parks, toys, handicrafts, educational institutions, insurance, finance, banking and investment sectors. 6th Bhava Health care, hospitals, pharmaceuticals, diagnostic centers, firearms, capital goods and textiles sector. 7th Bhava Foreign trades and exports sector. 8th Bhava Health care, diagnostic centers, hospitals and pharmaceutical sectors."}, "1927": {"doc_id": "astro_b3f1d367", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. th Bhava Health care, diagnostic centers, hospitals and pharmaceutical sectors. 9th Bhava Foreign trade, exports, aviation, shipping and tourism sector. 10th Bhava Power, nuclear energy and capital goods sector. 11th Bhava Investment, banking, finance and insurance sector. 12th Bhava Hospitality, hotels, health care, hospitals and footwear sector. Chapter 14 Reading opening bell chart Each Graha acts differently in different Bhavas of opening bell chart of stock market."}, "1928": {"doc_id": "astro_4d60f32f", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. aha acts differently in different Bhavas of opening bell chart of stock market. Result of Graha in different Bhavas depends upon its positional strength, by being ruler of Bhava or being in a friendly Bhava or in an enemy?s camp and benefic or malefic aspect it receives from other Grahas. When benefic Grahas aspect a Graha, then Graha delivers positive results for sectors signified by Bhava, and strong buying emerges in sectors signified by Bhava."}, "1929": {"doc_id": "astro_ec270fc8", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. rs signified by Bhava, and strong buying emerges in sectors signified by Bhava. Whereas, when malefic Grahas aspect a Graha, then Graha delivers negative results for sectors signified by Bhava, and selling pressure emerges in sectors signified by Bhava. Results of Grahas situated in Kendra Bhavas, 1st, 4th, 7th and 10th respectively, have strongest influence on markets. While results of Grahas situated in Trikona Bhavas, 1st, 5th and 9th respectively, also influence market in very Stock Market Astrology - 105 - Reading opening bell chart strong manner."}, "1930": {"doc_id": "astro_4796a521", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. n very Stock Market Astrology - 105 - Reading opening bell chart strong manner. Results of Grahas from 2nd and 8th Bhava remain moderate, and Grahas of 3rd, 6th, 8th and 12th Bhava remain weak in influencing markets. Here in this chapter I have explained influences of different Grahas situated in different Bhavas of opening bell chart of market. 14.1 Grahas in 1st Bhava First Bhava represents public sector units and power sectors. Mostly those units of other sectors, which are operated, governed or administered by government or state. Surya ?"}, "1931": {"doc_id": "astro_f2720791", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. s, which are operated, governed or administered by government or state. Surya ? Surya in first Bhava is good for power sectors and Gov. PSU's, especially public sector power stocks. PSU stocks will experience enhanced buying and prices move in a positive direction, especially if aspected by Chandr, Mangal or Guru. ? If Sukr, Sani, Rahu or Ketu aspect Surya in first Bhava, then buyers in PSU and power stocks dry up and sector witness stiff resistance with prices tending to fall down. Chandr ? Chandr in first Bhava brings volatility and fluctuations in power and PSU stocks."}, "1932": {"doc_id": "astro_29ede365", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. andr in first Bhava brings volatility and fluctuations in power and PSU stocks. If benefic Grahas like Surya, Budh or Guru aspects it then, fluctuations lead to price movement in a positive direction. ? Whereas, if afflicted by Sani, Rahu or Ketu, then volatility continues with negative bias in price charts. Mangal ? Mangal in first Bhava, aspected by Surya, Chandr or Guru, lead to a very aggressive buying in PSU's, power and capital goods sector stocks, whereas."}, "1933": {"doc_id": "astro_0fd7657b", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ery aggressive buying in PSU's, power and capital goods sector stocks, whereas. ? If Budh or Rahu aspect Mangal in first Bhava then result is outflow of liquidity from above sectors and stock prices melt down on selling pressure. Budh ? Well aspected Budh in first Bhava, aspected by Surya, Sukr, Guru, Sani or Rahu, is good for PSU banking stocks, PSU insurance companies, telecommunication PSU's, public sector aviation companies and IT sectors. ? Whereas, if Budh receives any malefic aspect from Chandr or Mangal, then stock prices of above mentioned sectors will show considerable decline."}, "1934": {"doc_id": "astro_1d1e6e9f", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. l, then stock prices of above mentioned sectors will show considerable decline. Guru ? Guru in first Bhava, aspected by Surya, Chandr or Mangal, is good for PSU stocks. PSU power, insurance, banking, refinery and oil marketing stocks surge up in their prices. Stock Market Astrology - 106 - Reading opening bell chart ? While selling pressure starts mounting up in above sectors if Guru in first Bhava is aspected by Budh or Sukr. Sukr ? Sukr in first Bhava, aspected by Rahu, Budh or Sani, is good for tourism sector, PSU hotels, resorts, banking and insurance sector stocks."}, "1935": {"doc_id": "astro_30eb95cc", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. d for tourism sector, PSU hotels, resorts, banking and insurance sector stocks. Entertainment and amusement industry stocks also follow positive momentum. Sugar stocks also rise price wise under benefic aspect to Sukr in first Bhava. ? Whereas, if Sukr in first Bhava is aspected by Surya or Chandr, then stock prices of above sectors face negative momentum and prices tend to slip down. Sani ? Sani in first Bhava, aspected by Budh, Sukr or Rahu, brings positive momentum in PSUs, iron & steel, coal, mining, capital goods, realty, infrastructure, oil marketing and refinery sector stocks."}, "1936": {"doc_id": "astro_d9e8fbe8", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. apital goods, realty, infrastructure, oil marketing and refinery sector stocks. ? Whereas if Sani in first Bhava is aspected by Surya, Chandr or Mangal, then it brings downslide in stock prices of above sectors. Rahu ? Rahu in first Bhava, aspected by Budh, Sukr or Sani, brings strong fluctuation with positive bias in stock prices of PSU units especially, telecommunication, metal and power sector stocks. ? Whereas, if Rahu in first Bhava is aspected by Surya, Chandr or Guru, then it brings extreme volatility and sudden downslide in stock prices of above sectors. Ketu ?"}, "1937": {"doc_id": "astro_09e0217a", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. xtreme volatility and sudden downslide in stock prices of above sectors. Ketu ? Ketu in first Bhava, aspected by Budh, Sukr or Sani, results into sudden and abnormal price behavior in oil & gas, metals and power sector stocks. ? Whereas, if Ketu in first Bhava is aspected by Surya, Chandr or Guru, then it brings sudden and strong selling pressure in stocks of above sectors, resulting into stock prices sharply sliding down. Uranus ?"}, "1938": {"doc_id": "astro_ddfa7230", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ks of above sectors, resulting into stock prices sharply sliding down. Uranus ? Uranus in first Bhava, aspected by Budh, Sukr or Sani, is good for PSU power stocks, nuclear energy sector, oil & gas, offshore refineries, telecommunication, aviation, realty and infrastructure stocks. ? Whereas, if Surya, Chandr or Mangal aspect Uranus in first Bhava, then it lead to a price volatility and selling pressure in above stocks. Stock Market Astrology - 107 - Reading opening bell chart Neptune ?"}, "1939": {"doc_id": "astro_f73b4272", "domain": "ASTRO", "text":