ils, crude, petroleum, gold, silver, aluminum, steel, milk and dairy products, peppermint, alcohol, rice, banking, finance and insurance sectors. ? Whereas, if Chandr in second Bhava is aspected by Sani, Rahu of Ketu then it cause volatility with negative bias and selling pressure in stock prices of above sectors. Mangal ?"}, "1942": {"doc_id": "astro_f01c554d", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. h negative bias and selling pressure in stock prices of above sectors. Mangal ? Mangal in second Bhava, aspected by Surya, Chandr or Guru, is good for automobile and cement sector stocks and prices of these stocks will move up. While this Mangal is bad for banking, FMCG, finance and insurance sector stocks and prices of these stocks will tend to slide down. ? Whereas, Mangal in second Bhava, aspected by Budh, tends to bring volatility in automobile, FMCG, banking, finance and insurance sector stocks and these sectors witness lower volume of trading."}, "1943": {"doc_id": "astro_0981b3b2", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. and insurance sector stocks and these sectors witness lower volume of trading. Stock Market Astrology - 108 - Reading opening bell chart Budh ? Budh in second Bhava, aspected by Surya, Sukr, Guru or Sani, is highly favorable for stock prices of telecommunications, banking, finance, insurance, aviation, FMCG, textile, IT, publications, exports and food grains. ? Whereas, if Budh in second Bhava is aspected by Chandr or Mangal, then it drags down investor sentiments and selling pressure mounts up, dragging stock prices down in sectors discussed above. Guru ?"}, "1944": {"doc_id": "a