, Sukr or Sani, results into price volatility for stock prices of telecommunication, banking, finance, insurance, FMCG, food grains, gold and jewelry. Sudden ups and downs can be visible in stock prices of above sectors. ? Whereas, if Rahu in second Bhava is aspected by Surya, Chandr or Guru, then it results into selling pressure within price volatility for stocks of above mentioned sectors, but recovery also tends to be equally fast. Ketu ?"}, "1947": {"doc_id": "astro_8b83cd6c", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. of above mentioned sectors, but recovery also tends to be equally fast. Ketu ? Ketu in second Bhava, aspected by Budh, Sukr or Sani, brings in strong selling pressure and negative momentum into stock prices of petroleum, oil & gas, crude, banking, finance, insurance, FMCG, copper and jewelry sectors. Stock Market Astrology - 109 - Reading opening bell chart ? Whereas, if Ketu in second Bhava is aspected by Surya, Chandr or Guru, then it drives investors in a confused manner and trading volumes turn low, although price volatility remain visible under this combination. Uranus ?"}, "1948": {"doc_id": "astro_44f83aed", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. low, although price volatility remain visible under this combination. Uranus ? Uranus in second Bhava is unfavorable for FMCG, banking, finance, insurance, jewelry, gold, eatable oils and food grains. Selling pressure or profit booking tends to dominate trading activity with stock prices sliding down as well as trading volume dries up for above sectors. Situation becomes worst if Uranus in second Bhava gets afflicted by any malefic Gra