ogy & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. ion, insurance, finance, banking and investment sector stocks of stock markets. Stock Market Astrology - 114 - Reading opening bell chart Surya ? Surya in fifth Bhava, aspected by Chandr, Mangal or Guru, is good for stock prices of entertainment, amusement parks, toys and handicrafts sectors, while educational institution, insurance, finance, banking and investment sector stocks will suffer from lack trading volumes. ? Whereas, if Surya in fifth Bhava is aspected by Sukr or Sani, then it brings in selling pressure into stocks of all above sectors and stock prices slip down. Chandr ?"}, "1974": {"doc_id": "astro_748d285e", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. pressure into stocks of all above sectors and stock prices slip down. Chandr ? Chandr in fifth Bhava, aspected by Surya or Budh, brings in moderate buying in entertainment, amusement parks, toys, handicrafts, educational institution, insurance, finance, banking and investment sector stocks. ? Whereas, if Chandr in fifth Bhava is aspected by Sani, Rahu or Ketu, it drags stock prices of above sectors down amidst high volatility in prices. Mangal ?"}, "1975": {"doc_id": "astro_96462a2f", "domain": "ASTRO", "text": "[AstroFinance Knowledge] Stock Market Astrology & Astrological Theory of Business Cycles (Indrodeep Banerjee, 2009). Topic: Indian/Vedic system, NSE sector-planet mapping, Nakshatras, Hora trading. s stock prices of above sectors down amidst high volatility in prices. Mangal ? Mangal in fifth Bhava, aspected by Surya, Chandr or Guru, brings negative price momentum in entertainment, amusement parks, toys, handicrafts, educational institution, insurance, finance, bankin